Spec: Test Suite

Platform: Jest/JavaScript

Purpose:
  Validate source behavior from outside the source tree.

Structure:
  ./tests.sdd: Test-suite spec.
  ./models/: Model tests.
  ./services/: Service tests.
  ./components/: Component tests.

Owns:
  Test organization and coverage expectations.
  ./tests.sdd
  ./models/*.test.js
  ./services/*.test.js
  ./components/*.test.js

Can modify:
  ./tests.sdd
  ./models/*.test.js
  ./services/*.test.js
  ./components/*.test.js

Can read:
  ../src/**

Must:
  Keep tests outside the source tree.
  Cover behavior required by source specs and scenarios.
  Use Jest for executable verification.

Must not:
  Define application source code.
  Weaken source architecture boundaries.

Done when:
  Relevant source scenarios have matching Jest coverage.
